title Zestora architecture

// ---- the browser side ----
User [icon: user]

Frontend React app [icon: react, color: blue] {
  Pages and components [icon: layout]
  Context Auth Cart Wishlist [icon: layers]
  Hooks useAsync [icon: code]
  Services api.js [icon: send]
  localStorage token and cart [icon: database]
}

Vite dev server 4200 [icon: zap, color: purple]

// ---- the server side ----
Backend FastAPI 8000 [icon: python, color: green] {
  Routers [icon: server]
  Security bcrypt and JWT [icon: lock]
  Business rules [icon: book-open]
  ORM models [icon: table]
  Mailer [icon: mail]
}

SQLite zestora db [icon: database, color: orange]
Dev inbox outbox eml [icon: inbox]
Gmail SMTP [icon: gmail]

// ---- connections ----
User > Pages and components: clicks and typing
Pages and components > Context Auth Cart Wishlist
Pages and components > Hooks useAsync
Hooks useAsync > Services api.js
Context Auth Cart Wishlist > Services api.js
Context Auth Cart Wishlist > localStorage token and cart: persists
Services api.js > Vite dev server 4200: fetch /api
Vite dev server 4200 > Routers: proxy to 8000
Routers > Security bcrypt and JWT
Routers > Business rules
Business rules > ORM models
Routers > ORM models
ORM models > SQLite zestora db: SQL
Routers > Mailer
Mailer > Dev inbox outbox eml: no SMTP password
Mailer > Gmail SMTP: SMTP configured
